[{"title":"忆旧八首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"吾慕吴音木，学问擅名宿。\n族望世江南，诗馀勤案牍。\n戟辕清昼长，莲幕秋风肃。\n相见复何时，遗函检行簏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11587,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧八首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"吾慕魏阶平，为人忠且诚。\n论文备今古，琢句含精英。\n焦尾琴堪听，磨云月更明。\n前途良未艾，何以老诸生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11588,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧八首 其三","author":"金朝觐","text":"吾慕郭镜我，艺文均当可。\n丰标绝俗尘，庶事无丛脞。\n国手出楸枰，婆心勤药裹。\n诗坛偶一来，列帜甘虚左。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11589,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧八首 其四","author":"金朝觐","text":"吾慕陈梅岑，春华努力深。\n文章消宦气，诗句杂仙心。\n骏誉鹏抟海，蜚声鹤在阴。\n四经留旧迹，遗线尚堪寻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11590,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧八首 其五","author":"金朝觐","text":"吾慕汪桂山，英风非等閒。\n开樽酒无量，脱稿诗不删。\n珊网登遗宝，蒲鞭警庶顽。\n会须膺上荐，翘首列仙班。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11591,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧八首 其六","author":"金朝觐","text":"吾慕李约亭，老吏著芳型。\n论事有先见，立言持正经。\n金银清夜气，仁寿出祥刑。\n几忆亲甘苦，居然两鬓星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11592,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧八首 其七","author":"金朝觐","text":"吾慕郭古樵，才思若涌潮。\n所居皆福地，一去杳云霄。\n鱼柬新诗寄，芦关旧雨遥。\n诗牌遗法在，几度共相招。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11593,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆旧八首 其八","author":"金朝觐","text":"吾慕章纫香，英华独擅场。\n砚田无歉薄，腹笥见缥缃。\n既探申韩秘，尤争李杜长。\n得朋良足乐，相忆复相望。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11594,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"留别李约亭明府","author":"金朝觐","text":"宦游惟君久，几经沧与桑。\n治乱若流水，升沈难等量。\n亦或郁烦恼，亦或欢衷肠。\n亦或安偃息，亦或食未遑。\n黔黎殷爱戴，量移来南方。\n青衣一带水，借润周四旁。\n榷木众以利，君来成浮梁。\n岂不擅明察，宽大实所长。\n岂不念终窘，仁厚实中藏。\n家既因官累，乃复空宦囊。\n郭氏旧金穴，无如寝邱良。\n我作严道吏，频登雅雨堂。\n石麓但交臂，古樵远相望。\n惟君处稍久，弹指历三霜。\n肝胆气相许，芝兰香共芳。\n为我理疑狱，为我监盘仓。\n濒行锡我赆，促我治归装。\n我行勿复念，望君日康彊。\n茀禄益纯固，晢嗣隆且昌。\n方今重西事，徵调及邻疆。\n筹饷县官急，输运出河湟。\n尤恐浮动众，乘虚作鸱张。\n所赖上苍佑，今岁获丰穰。\n目前既难恃，居安讵可常。\n我去君且住，旧游奚自忘。\n薄宦等閒事，固穷应惯尝。\n独念君亲重，图报终茫茫。\n呜呼知我兮爱我，心结兮心伤。\n悽怆兮前路，迢递兮故乡。\n江流兮日远，木落兮天凉。\n永怀兮不寐，怅别兮何方。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11595,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"青羊宫","author":"金朝觐","text":"藏梅珍玩属何王，古质斑斓色泽光。\n怪道金羊当鬼宿，积尸馀气闇文昌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11596,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"支机石","author":"金朝觐","text":"想是娲皇炼未成，相随织女下昆明。\n自从此石来天上，博得西川作锦城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11597,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"天涯石","author":"金朝觐","text":"天涯高且远，顽石擅其名。\n何处天涯是，人间无尽程。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11598,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"剑阁用唐刻原韵","author":"金朝觐","text":"万山送行客，客行山意回。\n连朝朔风发，积阴忽已开。\n长路间寒暑，悠悠思往来。\n山灵讵无意，几见济时才。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11599,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七盘关","author":"金朝觐","text":"南栈崎岖路不平，小心移步记分明。\n今朝已过西川境，从此宽怀放胆行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11600,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"伏波将军庙","author":"金朝觐","text":"戚畹能将阃外安，轻装薏苡载归鞍。\n即今遗庙存封守，竟作云台画里看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11601,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"紫柏山留侯祠","author":"金朝觐","text":"旧封祠汉相，留坝想英风。\n借箸师黄石，藏弓伴赤松。\n洞天邻少室，云栈接秦中。\n千载瞻遗像，居然处女同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11602,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和沔阳题壁怀古原韵","author":"金朝觐","text":"三分难厌蚩尤旗，赖有偏安鼎未移。\n郁郁军山终赍恨，滔滔汉水永方思。\n春秋大义文公笔，伊吕名贤杜老诗。\n何便桓温有矜色，可能妥帖似当时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11603,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"归里","author":"金朝觐","text":"风雪八千里，哀哉望里门。\n河干此诀别，父子各声吞。\n讵意成长逝，天高终莫扪。\n呼抢叩窀穸，咫尺间晨昏。\n游子有归日，灵帏空自存。\n起居弗能侍，应识心意烦。\n含殓弗能视，奚堪诚敬论。\n弥留既旬月，绝笔犹望孙。\n所赖谋身后，多资季与昆。\n哀哀此中结，将冀亲梦魂。\n忽若平生事，仰瞻无一言。\n乃知赍长恨，劳瘁空负恩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11604,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"慧麟侄出痘新愈于元旦日索诗因而赋此","author":"金朝觐","text":"履端嘉气至，綵笔写新春。\n淑鸟喧阳候，高楣启后人。\n远将绵嗣绪，上可慰慈亲。\n呼仆添炉火，题诗赐慧麟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11605,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哀思","author":"金朝觐","text":"三月旬初九，辞亲已五年。\n音容安可再，劳谕想从前。\n衔索鱼终朽，当风树不眠。\n故园易零落，春草几芊绵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11606,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"见杏花","author":"金朝觐","text":"又见山村发杏花，春光应已遍天涯。\n怯寒犹自重帏下，知道炊烟有几家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11607,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏史 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"秦兵起倾国，江左凯旋师。\n胜败寻常事，如何两不支。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11608,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏史 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"贫穷托冥报，富贵遗千金。\n一饭成恩遇，平生感已深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11609,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戊子十月二十六日引见乾清宫","author":"金朝觐","text":"七载重来觐阙庭，金门辨色又疏星。\n百忙岁月蓬壶旧，九折山溪蜀道经。\n敢望微官邀特简，何期薄绩达聪听。\n自维年壮犹堪试，橐笔还摹剑阁铭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11610,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与德立亭吏部","author":"金朝觐","text":"少年游艺共芳春，取次连镳只二人。\n小吏两番阶下立，口含天宪羡君身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11611,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"路上杂咏十首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"父子经长别，当时涕泪挥。\n今朝门外送，垂老一慈帏。\n长途行未已，秋潦复沈阴。\n勺水能兴浪，可知江海深。\n征衣不为薄，向晓生故凉。\n莫怅西风急，吹云见太阳。\n海气荒荒起，风云指顾期。\n不知天地大，推测自为奇。\n蜀道如天上，家山梦里逢。\n平冈互低伏，风景似临邛。\n新月如钩出，环弯挂远岑。\n旁临星一点，似写未成心。\n行年几五十，全局略将成。\n一为家声计，谋生安可轻。\n茹苦易于已，怜穷难所亲。\n长叹复何益，况有笑谈人。\n推心作交结，无自解人颐。\n安得一思我，正当平旦时。\n路逢诸弟子，相揖过车前。\n同此长安道，回思一惘然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11612,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"路上杂咏十首 黄叶二首之一 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"阴阴丛绿衬疏黄，点缀林光妙擅场。\n晚节花香终觉艳，平芜草短莫悲凉。\n新愁最易催人老，薄病犹堪靓晓妆。\n信识金风能度物，任他著色向秋阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11613,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"路上杂咏十首 黄叶二首之二 其三","author":"金朝觐","text":"翻疑橘柚踰淮生，秋入平林画不成。\n淡抹微烟含气早，初经凉雨挹尘轻。\n萧萧似有辞柯意，点点偏馀唤渡情。\n鏖战西风犹未已，满披金甲护山城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11614,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"路上杂咏十首 红叶四首之一 其四","author":"金朝觐","text":"夕阳山树隐隆隆，更有霜容著叶红。\n仙府紫霞常映日，灵禽丹绶漫迎风。\n不须载酒心如醉，却意飞花兴感同。\n旧宴曲江曾赐饼，香尘绮陌正春融。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11615,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"路上杂咏十首 红叶四首之二 其五","author":"金朝觐","text":"西来节候近澄清，路树临风最有情。\n绀碧几重深坞隐，朱殷一带夕阳晴。\n声中血性秋能语，梦起酡颜醉欲醒。\n我尚看花心未足，红梅只合待春明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11616,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"路上杂咏十首 红叶四首之三 其六","author":"金朝觐","text":"花容二月旧时春，霜叶殷红树树新。\n到眼秋光明绣陌，近畿风景识枫宸。\n赐绯乍可呼卢采，服紫真能化国人。\n几点燕山青未了，火云流影尚轮囷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11617,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"路上杂咏十首 红叶四首之四 其七","author":"金朝觐","text":"洗却尘容玉露寒，晴光烘染上林端。\n江枫向夕宜残照，墙杏争春竟误看。\n未老朱颜怜晚暮，从来紫气近长安。\n荆关图画分明在，写出秋心一种丹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11618,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"路上杂咏十首 其八 过燕山访侯孝廉","author":"金朝觐","text":"清明才过尚馀凉，十日征尘道阻长。\n山近桥陵皆拜伏，田环都邑尽康庄。\n春晴草木含新润，小别知交感异乡。\n见说窦家能育子，君今可得好儿郎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11619,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"路上杂咏十首 其九 再过邯郸","author":"金朝觐","text":"好梦占祥噩梦禳，惊心动魄是酣乡。\n何如化作飞蝴蝶，自在逍遥睡一场。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11620,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"路上杂咏十首 其十","author":"金朝觐","text":"四十年中顷刻殊，神仙作下睡工夫。\n我家日日黄粱熟，食后酣眠一梦无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11621,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"邺中怀古 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"疑冢纷纷误子孙，西陵芳草自黄昏。\n那知漳水沧桑易，竟被村童阚墓门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11622,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"邺中怀古 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"铜雀台荒霸业灰，岿然冢土邺城隈。\n如今片瓦犹珍赏，谁得陈思八斗才。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11623,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒鄂王祠再叠前韵","author":"金朝觐","text":"北略征衫带血腥，燐燐塞草夜含青。\n东窗有计诛名将，南渡何人问虏廷。\n遗墨流传争爱惜，停车修谒又重经。\n太平天下寻常事，谁向神前一乞灵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11624,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡黄河","author":"金朝觐","text":"黄河第九曲，都门当正阳。\n环拱二千里，平衍适中央。\n众流既奔汇，全势趋齐梁。\n金钱岁縻费，疏导兼堤防。\n往年忆北上，雨雪生寒凉。\n层冰蔽河下，悄然心悲伤。\n今我复南渡，洪波静不扬。\n含浊见本性，清流讵可常。\n观澜莫由挽，易逝惊就将。\n有怀缅曩代，分据各殊疆。\n一水限南北，时事何抢攘。\n干戈日未己，和亲难久长。\n孤臣念君国，游子思故乡。\n安知有后世，忧乐独中藏。\n临风试慨想，倚帆见北邙。\n北邙多故物，流水复茫茫。\n沙洲有出没，渚禽鸣且翔。\n极天望无际，初日上扶桑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11625,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过四知坊","author":"金朝觐","text":"祠墓规浑朴，千秋竟不磨。\n感恩殷暮夜，矢志皎星河。\n白璧原无玷，黄金孰厌多。\n关西延教泽，泾水挹清波。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11626,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"灵皈寺","author":"金朝觐","text":"隋唐宫殿已灰尘，梵宇巍峨更几新。\n图画丹青皆古艳，留题名姓尚先民。\n僧规浑朴具禅意，佛相庄严成贵人。\n我为钟声清入听，此来瞻礼或前因。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11627,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"佛手柑","author":"金朝觐","text":"莫道金身幻，黄柑具体真。\n拈花应欲语，合掌恰迎人。\n千手本无碍，拘挛终竟伸。\n倘承仙露润，盈掬自长春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11628,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题吴省庵小照 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"引得清光满纻罗，虬枝繁荫出高柯。\n斗然风过涛声响，不似惊心宦海波。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11629,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题吴省庵小照 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"丹青别具锦心肠，位置君家妙擅场。\n须识身安磐石稳，中怀坦易本平康。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11630,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀忠堂口占 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"绕郭青山万叠来，狂澜东下势难回。\n夕阳天末云峰起，恰有微风送晚雷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11631,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀忠堂口占 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"片云携雨过山头，似我辞家作宦游。\n纵有西风吹不散，轻阴随处又勾留。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11632,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"留别忠州书院诸生","author":"金朝觐","text":"白鹿杳难即，碧瓜无宿根。\n神灵幻俶诡，竹树易黄昏。\n永怀缅曩哲，风流千载存。\n江山不改色，遗泽留后昆。\n琅嬛开福地，桃李植公门。\n当世景先进，启心资圣言。\n敦崇旧仁里，士习民所尊。\n秉姿既醇朴，含气复温温。\n为我歌骊曲，为我侑清樽。\n欢乐得知感，富贵何足论。\n忆当试京兆，几度惊神魂。\n奔走藉升斗，夙心常自扪。\n吁嗟尔多士，为学须本原。\n忠厚载庸福，功名难畔援。\n青春易凋谢，回首但寒暄。\n临歧重寄语，诵诗羞素飧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11633,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答朱云岑书题后","author":"金朝觐","text":"风檐校艺日初长，燕寝凝香未底忙。\n且为郊行迟命驾，有怀良友写心藏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11634,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过中江城北偶得林丛二语已一易寒暑矣今续成之","author":"金朝觐","text":"又向邯郸梦里来，迢迢驿路旧官槐。\n林丛好鸟关心语，篱落秋花得意开。\n怀古山川当盛世，结交声气识英才。\n好音不入中郎听，祇恐焦桐是弃材。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11635,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宾兴宴赋诗二首 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"槐花争趁桂花黄，簌簌青芬拂客裳。\n有子读书真乐事，看君挟策上名场。\n秋风展骥嘶长路，春雨听莺到建章。\n今日堂前将进酒，江南司马一称觞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11636,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宾兴宴赋诗二首 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"从事丹铅孰后先，棘闱几度际蟾圆。\n万年嘉会开恩榜，八月崇阳预庆筵。\n华国文章争气运，逢时利器尚钻研。\n我今伫听檐前鹊，知有佳音特地传。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11637,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东阁官梅十咏补遗 其一","author":"金朝觐","text":"一度春风一度开，安排东阁号官梅。\n山中高士知多少，卧雪眠云望不来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11638,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东阁官梅十咏补遗 其二","author":"金朝觐","text":"竹树阴阴羃四郊，新晴刚见远山坳。\n东皇消息官衙早，几点新红出碧梢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11639,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东阁官梅十咏补遗 其三","author":"金朝觐","text":"岭上新枝好护持，春风隔岁漏花期。\n恨他开在黄花后，只为争先转觉迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11640,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东阁官梅十咏补遗 其四","author":"金朝觐","text":"清绝梅花不厌贫，因何呼作在官身。\n当时竞盛开东阁，负却深山富贵春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11641,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东阁官梅十咏补遗 其五","author":"金朝觐","text":"繁华满树著春容，老干又丫欲化龙。\n莫道落花情意索，摊书犹藉绿阴浓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11642,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东阁官梅十咏补遗 其六","author":"金朝觐","text":"杨花飘泊李花香，事隔隋唐已杳茫。\n留得梅花东阁在，清芬犹近浣花堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11643,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东阁官梅十咏补遗 其七","author":"金朝觐","text":"花封绣错此分符，阁外春深唤鹧鸪。\n只恐梅花来问我，庭前可有落花无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11644,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东阁官梅十咏补遗 其八","author":"金朝觐","text":"花间小集绿初团，风致嫣然春未阑。\n座客莫谈天宝事，美人零落易心酸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11645,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东阁官梅十咏补遗 其九","author":"金朝觐","text":"沈沈官鼓放朝衙，催报新枝第几花。\n可是公堂高万里，不曾春色到邻家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11646,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东阁官梅十咏补遗 其十","author":"金朝觐","text":"风流韵事说扬州，如此梅花几世修。\n想见少陵题咏处，草堂东阁各千秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11647,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游黄华山和王庭筠韵 其一","author":"李森先","text":"寂寞寒峰一古堂，任人传说总荒唐。\n王君何事偏投老，为爱秋山叶叶黄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11648,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游黄华山和王庭筠韵 其二","author":"李森先","text":"何处飞泉不作龙，台高玉女自清风。\n忽然天际生奇想，定有真人出上宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11649,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"朱鹭","author":"李锴","text":"鹭飞来，何常羊。\n鹭将栖，倡六茎。\n尊则有象彝有黄。\n器充厥实表乃章。\n鼓之咽咽，若存若亡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11650,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"艾如张","author":"李锴","text":"艾如张，张于田之下。\n左杀得鴽，右杀得鼠。\n前蹊芃芃立猛虎。\n劝君莫走马，走马马折跨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":11651,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]